.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
node_modules/
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, this matched every
# directory named "review" at any depth, which silently excluded the review
# engine and its tests from the repository for several commits while CI stayed
# green over what was left. This is only meant to ignore the top-level scratch
# directory that screenshots and manual review evidence are written to.
/review/
.next/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.data/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Private working material that must never reach the public repo:
# customer or employer protocols, real rulesets, anything proprietary.
docs/private/
